 {"label":"Inputs","value":"Last 10 games per team through Nov 21, 2026 for all 30 teams (300 team-games). Box scores from FantasyData (most games), plus SI.com, ESPN, NBA.com, CBS Sports and FantasyTeamAdvice where FantasyData wasn't reachable. Every game checked: player points sum to the team's final score. Opponent defensive rank/efficiency from the team-defense tab (ESPN opponent stats, 18 Nov 2026). Minutes rounded to the nearest minute."}]
